  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil and crackle the cumin seeds.",
    "Add the onion and green chillies and cook until golden, then add the ginger garlic paste.",
    "Add the tomatoes with the coriander powder, chilli powder, turmeric and salt and cook until thick and the oil separates.",
    "Add the mince and cook on high heat for 6 to 8 minutes, breaking up lumps, until it turns opaque.",
    "Add the water, cover and cook for 10 minutes on low heat.",
    "Stir in the garam masala, mint and lemon juice and cook uncovered for 2 minutes."
  ]
